}
```
Actually the hood should be part of cloak; draw dark green ring around head, with cream body around. The head is near front. Fine.
- Add a subtle cream rim light on cloak.
- Add scarf tail behind: starts at (2,-4) etc. Make more visible.
- Add a small lantern? no.
- Add a tiny directional nose? The face wedge.
- Add walking step: feet at local (±y) with forward/back offsets ±step along x. Draw before cloak.
- Body bob vertical screen.

Let's rewrite.

