...
if (pulse>0.8) { tiny dot }
```
Add a subtle 2.4px glow line? Use shadowBlur? Too expensive. Keep.

Also maybe add a broad, very low-alpha shimmer across the whole water area using a few large ellipses? Could draw waterLines.

